        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Heat, at tube collector, one-family house, for combined system
Use of a solar system excluding the necessary auxiliary heating.;
UUID: f198c711-83ab-3997-9a8f-54e2be81c69f
Delivery of heat with a solar system including maintenance and electricity use for operation. Excluding the necessary auxiliary heating.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Operation of a solar system, not including the necessary additional heating.
Time period: Time of simulation.
Production volume: Total solar heat delivered by evacuated tube collectors in 2001 was 2.3TJ.
Sampling: Simulation done by SPF Rapperswil with Polysun 3.3 computer programme. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_f198c711-83ab-3997-9a8f-54e2be81c69f.xml</text>
